    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ninja Clan</strong> is a <i>Strategy Card</i> game set in feudal Japan, where you must deal with a ninja clan that has seized power in the country and wreaked havoc. <br><br>In this fractured era, you won't be following a single main character; instead, you'll be collecting ninja cards, each with different stats. Consistently liberate the regions of Japan, reach the enemy base and crush it!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><br><strong><u>Collecting cards</u></strong><br>Collect ninja cards, get new ones and upgrade old abilities to use them effectively in battle<br><br><strong><u>Strategy developing</u></strong><br>Think over the strategy of your game, getting and using the abilities you need<br><br><strong><u>Equipment</u></strong><br>Collect your own combinations of equipment for each individual ninja in order to increase the characteristics you need",
